Chingari Koi Bhadke guitar chords with strumming pattern sung by Kishore Kumar from hindi movie Amar Prem. Old Hindi songs chords free online acoustic guitar lessons.

Strumming Pattern: DU U UDU

Capo on – 2nd Fret (Buy Cheap Capo)

Chin [Em]gaari koi bhadke to,        [Am]Saawan use bu [G]jhaaye
Saa [G]wan jo agan la [F]gaaye,        Use [Em]kaun bujhaaye

Pat [Em]jhad jo baag ujaade,        Wo [Am]baag bahaar khi [G]laaye
Jo [G]baag bahaar mein u [F]jade,        Use [Em]kaun khilaaye

Hum [Em]se mat poocho kaise,        Man [Am]dir toota sapnon ka
Lo [Am]gon ki baat na [G]hi hai,        Ye [F]kissa hai ap [Em]non ka

Koi [Em]dushman thess lagaaye,        To [Am]meet jiya beh [G]laaye
Man [G]meet jo ghaan [F]lagaaye,        Use kaun mi [Em]taaye

Naa [Em]jaane kya ho jaata,        Jaa [Am]ne hum kya kar jaate
[Am]Peete hain to jin [G]da hai,        Naa [F]peete to mar [Em]jaate

Duni [Em]ya jo pyaasa rakhe,        To [Am]madira pyaas bu [G]jhaaye
Madi [G]ra jo pyaas [F]lagaaye,        Use kaun [Em]bujhaaye

Maa [Em]na toofan ke aage,        Nahi [Am]chalta jor kisi ka
[Am]Maujon kaa dosh [G]nahi hai,        Ye [F]dosh hai aur [Em]kisi ka

Majh [Em]dhaar mein naiyya dole,        To [Am]maajhi paar la [G]gaaye
Maa [G]jhi jo naaw doo [F]boye,        Use kaun [Em]bachaaye
